{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander through a hand-crafted world filled with forgotten ruins, eerie forests, and ancient mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The making of this game starts in the physical realm. Each creature, mask, and environment is handcrafted from clay and real forest materials leaves, bark, roots, and more. These physical sculptures are then photoscanned and brought to life in the digital world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/9a8ecdf94a8df3e17035287cc1d3e861.poster.avif?t=1763644517\" width=236 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/9a8ecdf94a8df3e17035287cc1d3e861.webm?t=1763644517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/9a8ecdf94a8df3e17035287cc1d3e861.mp4?t=1763644517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter guardians</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat creatures by using the terrain and natural elements to try to bring down foes blocking your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/0d92f65f74d65bf2b25b33fc9ce12163.poster.avif?t=1763644517\" width=236 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/0d92f65f74d65bf2b25b33fc9ce12163.webm?t=1763644517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/extras/0d92f65f74d65bf2b25b33fc9ce12163.mp4?t=1763644517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the watchful gaze of haunting creatures and use clever tactics to slip past them unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to solve environmental puzzles that reveal the secrets of the land and unlock hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release Spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set spirits free, not knowing what their return might awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756370?t=1763644517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756370?t=1763644517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/9d213deb59c7ea4a2fbf79714c3e7a47927d277a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763644517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756370/9d213deb59c7ea4a2fbf79714c3e7a47927d277a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763644517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander through a hand-crafted world filled with forgotten ruins, eerie forests, and ancient mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The making of this game starts in the physical realm. Each creature, mask, and environment is handcrafted from clay and real forest materials leaves, bark, roots, and more. These physical sculptures are then photoscanned and brought to life in the digital world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl